<title>ZIMBABWE: ZIMBABWE'S TRUWORTHS RAISES YR SHR, DIV.</title>
<headline>ZIMBABWE'S TRUWORTHS RAISES YR SHR, DIV.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended July 6.</p>
<p>(million Zimbabwe dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)				   58.7 vs 50.8</p>
<p>    Div (cts)				   16.3 making 23 vs 18</p>
<p>    Pre-interest earnings		   27.1 vs 20.3</p>
<p>    Interest				     5.0 vs  0.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax earnings			  22.1 vs 20.8</p>
<p>    Taxation				     3.7 vs  4.9</p>
<p>    Attrib. earnings			  18.4 vs 15.9</p>
<p>    Turnover				   234.0 vs 151.7</p>
<p>Div payable October 31 </p>
<p>on register October 18.</p>
<p>Full name: Truworths Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom +263-4 72 52 28/9</p>
</text>
